From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 09:17:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Cache goal activity by request-time source changes

Replace global two-second answer TTL and repeated profile glob/realpath walks with bounded directory membership and per-database main/WAL/journal signature caches. Reads remain batched and short-lived; changed or failed sources invalidate before reread, and racing writes prevent publication. Proof: prior head failed immediate-commit and unchanged-expired-read regressions; 10 focused tests pass including WAL changes, replacement/removal, retry, race and closed handles. Live CPU acceptance remains pending.
---
 hermes_cli/goal_session_activity.py           | 106 +++++++++++-------
 .../hermes_cli/test_goal_session_activity.py  | 103 +++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 168 insertions(+), 41 deletions(-)

